          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the trumpet to thy mouth. As an eagle ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " against the house of Jehovah, because they have transgressed my covenant, and trespassed against my law. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall cry unto me, My God, we Israel know thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel hath cast off that which is good: the enemy shall pursue him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have set up kings, but not by me; they have made princes, and I knew it not: of their silver and their gold have they made them idols, that they may be cut off. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hath cast off thy calf, O Samaria; mine anger is kindled against them: how long will it be ere they attain to innocency? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For from Israel is even this; the workman made it, and it is no God; yea, the calf of Samaria shall be broken in pieces. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they sow the wind, and they shall reap the whirlwind: he hath no standing grain; the blade shall yield no meal; if so be it yield, strangers shall swallow it up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel is swallowed up: now are they among the nations as a vessel wherein none delighteth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they are gone up to Assyria, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " a wild ass alone by himself: Ephraim hath hired lovers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, though they hire among the nations, now will I gather them; and they begin to be diminished by reason of the burden of the king of princes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because Ephraim hath multiplied altars for sinning, altars have been unto him for sinning. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I wrote for him the ten thousand things of my law; but they are counted as a strange thing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As for the sacrifices of mine offerings, they sacrifice flesh and eat it; but Jehovah accepteth them not: now will he remember their iniquity, and visit their sins; they shall return to Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For Israel hath forgotten his Maker, and builded palaces; and Judah hath multiplied fortified cities: but I will send a fire upon his cities, and it shall devour the castles thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
